00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:24.320
related, YouTube income, etc. My vlog

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:26.320
channel is very specific to mom content.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:28.080
Mom days in my life, mom vlogs, and

